{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/58176-turn-blade","id":58176,"title":"Turn Blade","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-26T10:44:00-08:00","id":58176,"title":"Turn Blade","content":"So, a few buddies and I were skimming the preview, and we thought this power stuck out. Since it's reflexive, can a Demon use this on himself and his fellows for every turn, making the group only take Bashing for all Lethal attacks? Even from firearms? That feels like a HUGE boost.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2110-confide-and-we-concede","name":"Confide and We Concede","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-27T05:52:10-08:00","id":58645,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure if its spelled out in the rules anywhere, but I've been ruling that while you can do any number of reflexive actions per turn, you can do each reflexive action only once per turn. So only 1 Turn Blade per turn, but you can also add a Just Bruised to protect from a second attack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1105-hulsmanm","name":"hulsmanm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}